\subsection{Cross-Model Validation}
\label{sec:cross-model}

To verify that the convergence pattern and the 30$\times$ training-inference gap are not specific to the Qwen architecture, we are conducting parallel experiments on Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct. Llama-3.1 differs from Qwen-2.5 in several architectural choices, including grouped-query attention with 8 KV heads and a distinct BPE tokenizer, providing a meaningful test of generalization across model families. Results will be reported in the final version of this paper.

